  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DcemWeskeZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yHlVxSj.png\" alt=\"discord banner\" width=\"140\" height=\"34\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>關於</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Visuality 是一款專為 Fabric Loader 設計的 Minecraft 模組。這是一款僅限客戶端的裝飾性模組，將為您的 Minecraft 世界增添大量全新粒子效果，包含水晶閃光、生物受擊粒子、史萊姆專屬圓形粒子以及環境粒子等。隨著模組更新，粒子效果庫將持續擴充！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>設定</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以透過編輯 Minecraft 目錄下 config 資料夾中的 visuality.json 檔案來設定此模組，或直接使用 ModMenu 整合介面進行調整。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>展示</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b36gkYh.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZNvWWow.gif\" width=\"400\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NKeDOcG.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/896630240170889246/904458353206509618/circles_on_water_2.gif\" width=\"400\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>更多內容</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvisuality\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></strong></a></span></p>",
